# Audited packaging list (issue #502): the VSIX ships the extension entry,
# the bundled bb_lsp server, and the honesty documents. Everything else is a
# dev artifact and must stay out.
.vscode/**
src/**
esbuild-extension.mjs
collect-server-deps.mjs
tsconfig.json
node_modules/**
**/*.map
**/*.ts
!dist/**
verification-*.png

# server binary must remain: dist/server/lsp/server.js (audit rule AB3)
# AND its runtime deps: dist/server/node_modules/** (better-sqlite3 native
# build + drizzle-orm) — without them the bundled server dies with
# ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND before initialize (owner spot-check defect, 2026-09-05).
